 "uncertain": [
  {
   "item": "Meuse sector respread and quality classes (Sedan audit)",
   "note": "S08 sources: 55th Division at Sedan, 71st relieving it (partly by 10 May, completed 13-14 May), both Series B reservists over 30 with little training and short of anti-tank/anti-aircraft guns; X Corps held Remilly-Aillicourt; Ninth/Second Army divisions chiefly poor quality. NOT sourced: which 9th Army division held which Meuse segment, the positions of XVIII Corps divisions (placed Stenay-Longuyon), XXI Corps assembly area (3rd DCR / 3rd DIM placed near Rethel), the series of each division. All start positions are approximate river-segment anchors (G03). Series B experience 25 / morale 62 / organisation 75 / start entrenchment 20 and posture hold (entrenchment cap 40: S08 bunkers incomplete, no mines at Sedan), fortress divisions 35/68 (Maginot 104th/105th start entrenchment 50), other 9th/2nd Army infantry 40/65/80 are GAME-SCALE (G01), not historical."
  },
  {
   "item": "All unit start positions",
   "note": "Approximate sector/assembly areas (G03); no source gives division start locations."
  },
  {
   "item": "German 15th, 4th Infantry Divisions",
   "note": "Assigned to different corps/army groups in S01 vs S02; OMITTED."
  },
  {
   "item": "German 211th ID",
   "note": "Listed under V Corps (S01) and XI Corps (S02); placed under V Corps only."
  },
  {
   "item": "German 3rd ID",
   "note": "III Corps in S01; unassigned in S02; placed in III Corps (12. Armee)."
  },
  {
   "item": "German 6th Mountain Division, SS-Verfügungstruppe Division, XXXIX Corps",
   "note": "Listed by sources but unclear/inconsistent for 10 May; OMITTED."
  },
  {
   "item": "Army Group C divisions",
   "note": "Single source (S03); lower confidence."
  },
  {
   "item": "French armoured reserve positions (1st-3rd DCR, 3rd DIM)",
   "note": "No location sourced; placed in a reserve area behind the Meuse (approximate). 4th DCR arrival 15 May is approximate/unverified."
  },
  {
   "item": "French 4th Army, Army of the Alps divisions, Polish divisions, 12th/23rd/46th BEF labour divisions, 1st Armoured Division, 52nd/1st Canadian Divisions",
   "note": "Omitted: role/arrival not verified (S12 gives only Second BEF composition from 2 June)."
  },
  {
   "item": "Belgian and Dutch corps",
   "note": "Corps-level only; positions are an approximate arc. Divisions omitted."
  },
  {
   "item": "Italian army and Luftwaffe/RAF/Armée de l'Air",
